[Side "white"]
[Event "Black avoids 2...Nc6"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d6 {The Philidor Defense: solid but passive.} 3. d4 {Strike the center immediately.} exd4 (3... Nd7 4. Bc4 c6 5. O-O Be7 6. a4 {Gaining space on the queenside.}) 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Be7 6. Bf4 O-O 7. Qd2 {Preparing long castling.} *

