[Event "Petrov Defense: 2...Nf6"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nf6 {Symmetrical counterattack.} 3. Nxe5 d6 (3... Nxe4 $2 4. Qe2 {Pins the knight — Black is in trouble.} Qe7 5. Qxe4 d6 6. d4 dxe5 7. dxe5 {White is a pawn up.}) 4. Nf3 {Never 4.Nxf7?! — just retreat.} Nxe4 5. d4 d5 6. Bd3 Be7 7. O-O *
